---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Lighting a Vedolux 37 | Smokeless Heat Blog" description="This YouTube video shows a Vedolux 37 owner lighting the boiler and shows the first 8 minutes or so of the fire.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Operation</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">Lighting a Vedolux 37</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This YouTube video shows a Vedolux 37 owner lighting the boiler and covers the first 8 minutes or so of the fire. It demonstrates how easy these boilers are to light and how quickly the boiler comes up to temperature.
        </p>

        <p>
          The Vedolux 30, 37, and 55 can all be lit using this method. By keeping the bypass closed, you get a very fast startup sequence.
        </p>

        <p>
          The method in the boiler manual uses a starting sequence with the bypass open, which also works. This video shows my preferred method of startup.
        </p>

        <p>
          Normally, the Vedolux natural draft boiler needs to be started with the bypass open for about 5 minutes to develop draft velocity. Then the damper is lowered and the boiler begins to burn “upside-down” in its gasification mode.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-4">Video</h2>
          <div class="aspect-video w-full">
            <iframe 
              width="100%" 
              height="100%" 
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LMwSp06HVBE" 
              title="Lighting a Vedolux 37" 
              frameborder="0" 
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
              allowfullscreen
              class="rounded border border-wood/20"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-wood mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-wood/20">
          Originally published: March 2015
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
